 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043650/extras/90fd4935f7e54dc1f85cf0b31f0c99a7.avif?t=1780577451\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043650/extras/bafefbaaf368c0a2a5b0397735cf8092.poster.avif?t=1780577451\" width=1170 height=1170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043650/extras/bafefbaaf368c0a2a5b0397735cf8092.webm?t=1780577451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043650/extras/bafefbaaf368c0a2a5b0397735cf8092.mp4?t=1780577451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the location of your fields wisely, then plant your seeds and wait for your plants to grow. Harvest the resources that are fully grown. Always make sure you will have the right resources at the right time in order to build solid defences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043650/extras/3d1b9bfad1a01065a0207045afe6a22d.avif?t=1780577451\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s